<title>USA: Meris Laboratories names new CEO, president.</title>
<headline>Meris Laboratories names new CEO, president.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meris Laboratories Inc said Thursday it has named William McCormick president and chief executive.</p>
<p>McCormick was most recently president and chief executive of a company handling electronic claims processing and technology solutions for the health care industry, the company said.</p>
</text>
